WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.530
Review the fictional guide as a first-time participant.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:11.912
Can the person identify the task, find the inputs, complete the estimate and compare it with the review standard?

00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:15.442
Check facts, arithmetic, readable instructions and labeled fields.

00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:18.530
Essential spoken instructions need a readable equivalent.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:25.148
Use the approved AI request to organize the experience, then reject invented support and guarantees.

00:00:25.148 --> 00:00:29.560
Demonstrate the practice result and explain how it was checked.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:36.178
Label a scenario as a scenario; it does not establish actual audience usefulness or demand.

00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:42.355
Save the frame, outline, complete sample and review evidence in the same Project Record.

00:00:42.355 --> 00:00:45.884
Record the removed AI-history section and revised sample.

00:00:45.884 --> 00:00:50.296
Reference the existing staff practice resource and retain unresolved assumptions.

00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:56.032
Use the associated workbook and carry this sample into Lesson Four Point Three.
